Package: earport
Architecture: linux-any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, bluez, gnome-shell (>= 46)
Description: AirPods integration for GNOME
 EarPort brings AirPods to the GNOME desktop: battery levels in the panel
 and Quick Settings, noise control modes (noise cancellation, transparency,
 adaptive), conversation awareness, and media paused when an AirPod leaves
 the ear. A small service talks to the AirPods over Bluetooth; the GNOME
 Shell extension shows it.
